        "id": "intro",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Talking Avatar from a Photo and a Script\n\n**Talking Avatar from a Photo and a Script** creates a spoken presenter clip from one portrait image and a line of copy.\n\n1. **Script** feeds **TextToSpeech**, **Normalize**, **FadeIn**, and **FadeOut** to produce a broadcast-level voiceover.\n2. **Portrait Photo** and **Framing Prompt** drive **ImageToVideo** to generate subtle presenter motion.\n3. **LipSync** aligns the presenter's lip movements to the leveled voice track."
        },
        "position": {
          "x": 80,
          "y": -220
        },
        "width": 700,
        "height": 180
      },
